          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतिबुध्यते — pratibudhyate — \"awakes\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरुणः प्रातः शीघ्रं प्रतिबुध्यते। aruṇaḥ prātaḥ śīghraṃ pratibudhyate. Arun wakes early in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): सः प्रातः प्रतिबुद्धवान्, saḥ prātaḥ pratibuddhavān."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रतिबुध्यते (pratibudhyate) is built from prati and the root √budh, \"to wake, to know\", the root of बुध्यते; MW gives \"to awaken, awake, wake\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
